<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { title }) %>
</head>
<body class="public-page">
  <%- include('partials/icon-sprite') %>
  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="form-wrap">
    <div class="kiosk-header">
      <img class="form-logo" src="/img/logo.png" alt="Sanford Homeschoolers" />
      <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="form-outer-panel">
      <h2>Using This Portal</h2>
      <p>This member portal is provided by Sanford Homeschoolers for current and prospective member families to manage memberships, classes, attendance, events, and related co-op business. By registering for an account, you agree to provide accurate information and to use the portal only for its intended purposes.</p>

      <h2>SMS Text Messaging</h2>
      <p>If you opt in to SMS notifications, you agree to receive text messages from Sanford Homeschoolers at the phone number you provide, related to co-op announcements, event reminders, schedule changes, and similar co-op business. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. You can opt out at any time by replying STOP to any message, or by updating your Notification Preferences in your account. Reply HELP for help. See our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> for how we handle your information, including your phone number and SMS consent.</p>

      <h2>Account Responsibility</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for keeping your login credentials confidential and for all activity under your account. New registrations are reviewed and approved by a co-op administrator before access is granted.</p>

      <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these Terms and Conditions from time to time. Continued use of the portal after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Contact a co-op administrator through the portal.</p>

      <p class="hint">Last updated: <%= lastUpdated %></p>
      <a class="primary-btn" href="/">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
